{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068410/extras/885af019b12d025f565ba3dd64c539d8.avif?t=1772728109\" width=600 height=128 /></span><br><br><i>Have you ever wondered how video games are made? Is it your life long dream to work in the gaming industry? Today is your lucky day! We may have the perfect position for you. Come work for us in this &quot;challenging&quot; environment where everything that can go wrong will absolutely go wrong.<br><br>We offer you valuable experience such as :<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fixing other people\u2019s mistakes<br></li><li>Getting blamed for everything because you\u2019re just an intern<br></li><li>Having your butt kicked by heroes on a daily basis</li></ul><br>Each day is different here and you will have to face new problems that makes you wonder about your own sanity. I hope you will apply for the job and discover the secrets of the video games industry!<br><br>Your future boss</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068410/extras/e8f24017998fbeb37077a19294f36aa0.poster.avif?t=1772728109\" width=640 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068410/extras/e8f24017998fbeb37077a19294f36aa0.webm?t=1772728109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068410/extras/e8f24017998fbeb37077a19294f36aa0.mp4?t=1772728109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Every chapter is a new day with unique gameplay and challenges. You won't get bored!<br></li><li>Beautiful environments that remind you that you're stuck at work and - wait did that fake pyramid just fall on the floor?<br></li><li>Drama, joy, tragedy, nonsense... Just like your regular 9 to 5 job<br></li><li>Lots of side quests &amp; secrets scattered all over the madhouse that is your office building<br></li><li>4 monster costumes each with different abilities and unique cuteness<br></li><li>A handful of coworkers to share a coffee with while listening to their complains<br></li><li>Great corporate meta humor that feels like a crying emoji in a powerpoint about why you are fired</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068410/extras/d73670762898362b8190ac11ea27af3f.avif?t=1772728109\" width=640 height=160 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"7a2568d8ee78243c0fe19b4dbaac5e30a5c2d6f6.jpg","localized_name":"Day one","name":"Day one","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1068410/7a2568d8ee78243c0fe19b4dbaac5e30a5c2d6f6.jpg"},{"icon":"7c44e4f34fddeb955eb3787aeeb21240da54d4fe.jpg","localized_name":"Factory settings","name":"Factory settings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1068410/7c44e4f34fddeb955eb3787aeeb21240da54d4fe.jpg"},{"icon":"29eecdc18969caaf2ad261af460a910045d98002.jpg","localized_name":"Investing","name":"Investing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1068410/29eecdc18969caaf2ad261af460a910045d98002.jpg"},{"icon":"50257a638a6db6d4e3f07cc34b839f09f3ac8719.jpg","localized_name":"Take that!","name":"Take that!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1068410/50257a638a6db6d4e3f07cc34b839f09f3ac8719.jpg"},{"icon":"c2ef3ceda0f30656cd23ac157ed2ac4b54b4e175.jpg","localized_name":"Death, finally","name":"Death, finally","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1068410/c2ef3ceda0f30656cd23ac157ed2ac4b54b4e175.jpg"},{"icon":"a1d20e62634059ccef04b812b6ae2393ba60f3ee.jpg","localized_name":"Not a good start","name":"Not a goo